# Affixes Page
guide.adversity.affixes.title=Affix Encyclopedia
guide.adversity.affixes.intro=Affixes are special abilities granted to elite monsters. They scale with difficulty tier. Baubles and enchantments provide counterplay. The following lists all known affixes.

guide.adversity.affixes.offensive=§c⚔ Offensive Affixes
guide.adversity.affixes.fiery=§6Fiery§r: Stacks burning (5 stacks = fire burst). Heat aura + fire trail. §7[Counter: Flame Ward]
guide.adversity.affixes.frosty=§bFrosty§r: Stacks freeze (8 stacks = full freeze). Frost aura + frozen ground. §7[Counter: Frost Ward]
guide.adversity.affixes.withering=§8Withering§r: Stacks decay reducing armor (6 stacks = rot burst). Decay aura. §7[Counter: Corrosion Bane]
guide.adversity.affixes.blunt=§7Blunt§r: More armor = more damage taken (+4% per armor point, max +150%).
guide.adversity.affixes.giant_slayer=§7Giant Slayer§r: More max HP = more damage taken (+2% per HP above 20, max +200%).
guide.adversity.affixes.shield_breaker=§7Shield Breaker§r: More absorption = more damage taken (+8% per yellow heart, max +250%).
guide.adversity.affixes.bloodthirst=§4Bloodthirst§r: Lower player HP% = more damage dealt. Exponential scaling below 50% HP.
guide.adversity.affixes.avarice=§eAvarice§r: More occupied inventory slots = more damage (+3%/slot, max +150%). §7[Counter: Light Amulet]
guide.adversity.affixes.greed=§eGreed§r: More baubles equipped = more damage (+15%/bauble, max +100%).
guide.adversity.affixes.reaper=§5Reaper§r: Fewer player deaths = stronger monster (up to +200% dmg, +50% speed).
guide.adversity.affixes.nightmare=§5Nightmare§r: Fear effect + slowness + phantom damage that ignores armor.

guide.adversity.affixes.curses=§4⚠ Permanent Curses (Irreversible!)
guide.adversity.affixes.black_swan=§4Black Swan§r: §cPERMANENT§r attack power reduction, stacks infinitely. §7[Counter: Guardian Heart]
guide.adversity.affixes.black_friday=§4Black Friday§r: §cPERMANENT§r max HP reduction, stacks infinitely. §7[Counter: Guardian Heart]
guide.adversity.affixes.black_coffin=§4Black Coffin§r: §cPERMANENT§r inventory slot seal. §7[Counter: Guardian Heart]

guide.adversity.affixes.defensive=§a🛡 Defensive Affixes
guide.adversity.affixes.reflective=§eReflective§r: Reflects melee damage back to attacker. Ratio scales with tier. §7[Counter: True Crystal]
guide.adversity.affixes.regenerating=§aRegenerating§r: Continuous health regeneration. §7[Counter: Wither Mark]
guide.adversity.affixes.hardened=§7Hardened§r: Immune to knockback + super armor (30% damage reduction for 1s after hit, 2s cooldown).
guide.adversity.affixes.fortified=§7Fortified§r: Below 50% HP gains armor (+1.5% per 1% HP missing, max +150%). Extra bonus below 30%.
guide.adversity.affixes.hero=§eHero§r: Damage taken becomes square root (√x). 100dmg→10, 16dmg→4. §7[Mutually exclusive with Divine/OuterGod]
guide.adversity.affixes.divine=§bDivine§r: Damage taken becomes cube root (∛x). 125dmg→5, 27dmg→3. §7[Mutually exclusive with Hero/OuterGod]
guide.adversity.affixes.outer_god=§5Outer God§r: Damage taken becomes 4th root (x^0.25). 256dmg→4, 10000dmg→10. Only from Ascension. §7[Ultimate defense]
guide.adversity.affixes.adaptive=§9Adaptive§r: Remembers damage types, reducing repeated damage progressively.
guide.adversity.affixes.antimagic=§5Antimagic§r: Immune to magic damage. 6-block aura nullifies player positive potions. §7[Counter: Antimagic Ward]
guide.adversity.affixes.symbiotic=§dSymbiotic§r: Shares damage with nearby allies of the same type.
guide.adversity.affixes.shedding=§aShedding§r: 25% chance to survive lethal damage: revives to 30% HP, clears debuffs, gains speed. Once per mob.
guide.adversity.affixes.ascension=§6Ascension§r: On death, upgrades defense affix: Hero→Divine→OuterGod chain. §7[Counter: Soul Seal Dust]

guide.adversity.affixes.utility=§d⚡ Utility Affixes
guide.adversity.affixes.teleporting=§dTeleporting§r: Teleports to random position after being hurt. §7[Counter: Spatial Anchor]
guide.adversity.affixes.blinding=§8Blinding§r: Applies screen blind effect + reduces attack power. §7[Counter: Clarity Lens]
guide.adversity.affixes.horror=§5Horror§r: Applies screen fear effect + knockback + slowness. §7[Counter: Courage Charm]
guide.adversity.affixes.shackle=§8Shackle§r: Seals random equipment slots on attack. §7[Counter: Soul Chain]
guide.adversity.affixes.divest=§cDivest§r: 25% chance to seal a random bauble into a token (auto-restores after ~20s). No Baubles mod = seals hand item. §7[Counter: Spatial Anchor]
guide.adversity.affixes.disenchant=§5Disenchant§r: 20% chance to temporarily SILENCE all enchantments on one equipment piece for 60s+. §7[Counter: Enchant Guardian]
guide.adversity.affixes.gravity=§9Gravity§r: Pulls player toward the monster. §7[Counter: Anchor Stone]
guide.adversity.affixes.haste=§bHaste§r: Permanently increased movement speed.
guide.adversity.affixes.splitting=§aSplitting§r: Splits into 2 weaker copies on death (half HP). Copies cannot split again and drop no loot. §7[Counter: Phantom Cloak]
guide.adversity.affixes.oblivion=§8Oblivion§r: Causes player to lose experience on attack. §7[Counter: Memory Crystal]
guide.adversity.affixes.tetanus=§2Tetanus§r: After 5 consecutive hits, drains 50% of player current HP. Hit counter decays after 10s. §7[Counter: Immunity Badge]
guide.adversity.affixes.reversal=§cReversal§r: Inverts damage scaling — weak attacks deal MORE, strong attacks deal LESS. Use weak weapons! §7[Counter: Balance Charm]

guide.adversity.affixes.special=§6★ Special Affixes
guide.adversity.affixes.vampiric=§4Vampiric§r: 20%+3%/tier lifesteal. Blood debt stacking system. Below 30% HP enters frenzy (+50% lifesteal). Blood chain aura.
guide.adversity.affixes.purifier=§ePurifier§r: STEALS a positive potion from player and transfers it to the mob. 30s potion lockout on player.
guide.adversity.affixes.unclean=§2Unclean§r: Applies random debuff combinations on attack.
guide.adversity.affixes.annihilate=§cAnnihilate§r: On attack, randomly deletes a player inventory item into the void temporarily.
guide.adversity.affixes.thorny=§2Thorny§r: Melee attackers gain "thorn" stacks (+10% damage taken per stack). At 5 stacks triggers piercing true damage.

