guide.adversity.rituals.title=Ritual System
guide.adversity.rituals.intro=Rituals are powerful magical effects executed at a Sanctuary Altar by consuming items and Entropy fuel.
guide.adversity.rituals.how_to=How to Perform Rituals
guide.adversity.rituals.how_to.desc=Place the required item in the ritual input slot of the Sanctuary GUI. Ensure sufficient Entropy fuel is available, then click the Execute button.
