# Progression Page
guide.adversity.progression.title=Game Progression
guide.adversity.progression.intro=The core gameplay revolves around difficulty growth and acquiring countermeasures. Here is the recommended progression flow.
guide.adversity.progression.stages=Progression Stages
guide.adversity.progression.stage.0=Stage 0 - Early Game: Gather resources near spawn, prepare basic equipment
guide.adversity.progression.stage.1=Stage 1 - First Exploration: Expand outward, find your first Natural Sanctuary (~1000 blocks)
guide.adversity.progression.stage.2=Stage 2 - Build Network: Activate multiple sanctuaries, collect Entropy, craft first baubles
guide.adversity.progression.stage.3=Stage 3 - Hunt Elites: Use baubles and enchantments to purposefully hunt elites for resources
guide.adversity.progression.stage.4=Stage 4 - Deep Expedition: Challenge T8+ zones for ultimate rewards

# Permanent Curses
guide.adversity.curses.title=Permanent Curse System
guide.adversity.curses.intro=At very high difficulty (8+), elite mobs may carry permanent curse affixes. These apply irreversible penalties that persist across death.
guide.adversity.curses.warning=§c⚠ Warning: Permanent curses cannot be removed by normal means! Only the Purge Curse ritual at a Sanctuary can help.
guide.adversity.curses.black_swan=§4Black Swan§r: Each hit permanently reduces your attack damage. Stacks infinitely.
guide.adversity.curses.black_friday=§4Black Friday§r: Each hit permanently reduces your max health. Stacks infinitely.
guide.adversity.curses.black_coffin=§4Black Coffin§r: Each hit permanently seals one inventory slot. Sealed slots cannot be used.
guide.adversity.curses.counter=§aCountermeasure§r: Use the Purge Curse ritual (牛奶桶/1000 Entropy) or reach a Sanctuary to suppress effects.

# Nightmare System
guide.adversity.nightmare.title=Nightmare System
guide.adversity.nightmare.intro=The Nightmare system spawns elite mobs near players who sleep in beds, representing the horrors of dreams.
guide.adversity.nightmare.trigger=§cTrigger§r: Sleeping in a bed. Mobs spawn upon waking.
guide.adversity.nightmare.scaling=§eScaling§r: Nightmare mob difficulty scales with player kill count and distance.
guide.adversity.nightmare.tip=§aTip§r: Sleeping in a Sanctuary greatly reduces nightmare intensity.

# Overview Page
guide.adversity.overview.title=Welcome to Adversity
guide.adversity.overview.intro=Adversity adds progressive challenges to Minecraft. As you explore further and survive longer, monsters become stronger and more dangerous. This guide will help you understand the mechanics and find counterplay strategies.
guide.adversity.overview.difficulty=Difficulty System
guide.adversity.overview.difficulty.desc=Difficulty is based on two factors: distance from spawn and play time. The further you go and the longer you survive, the harder it gets. Difficulty ranges from 1.0 to 10.0.
guide.adversity.overview.elites=Elite Mobs
guide.adversity.overview.elites.desc=Mobs in high-difficulty areas may become "elites". Elite mobs have more health, deal more damage, and carry special affix abilities. Killing elites yields rare drops.
guide.adversity.overview.affixes=Affix System
guide.adversity.overview.affixes.desc=Elite mobs carry Affixes - special abilities like Fiery (burning attacks), Frosty (freeze effect), Teleporting, etc. Affixes are categorized as Offensive, Defensive, Utility, or Special.
guide.adversity.overview.counterplay=Counterplay Options
guide.adversity.overview.counterplay.desc=This mod provides multiple counterplay options: Sanctuaries provide safe zones, Baubles offer passive protection, Enchantments enhance equipment. Using these mechanics wisely is key to survival!

# Sanctuary Page
guide.adversity.sanctuary.title=Sanctuary System
guide.adversity.sanctuary.intro=Sanctuaries are safe zones that significantly reduce elite spawns and enhance your bauble effects. There are two types: Natural and Artificial.

guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural=Natural Sanctuary
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.desc=Natural sanctuaries are underground quartz shrines with indestructible altars and surrounding blocks, providing strong protection.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.find=Location: Natural sanctuaries generate every ~1000 blocks at Y=32 in underground quartz shrines
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.activate=Activation: Right-click the Sanctuary Altar, requires entropy items as fuel
guide.adversity.sanctuary.natural.effect=Effect: Completely blocks elite spawns, bauble effects at 100%%

guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial=Artificial Sanctuary
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.desc=Artificial sanctuaries are player-built structures that provide moderate protection.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.build=Construction: 3x3x3 stone brick structure with Sanctuary Core in center
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.materials=Materials: Sanctuary Core crafted with obsidian + chiseled stone brick + Entropy Core
guide.adversity.sanctuary.artificial.effect=Effect: Reduces elite spawn chance by 30%%, bauble effects at 50%%. Outside sanctuary, effects drop to base value.

guide.adversity.sanctuary.structure=Multiblock Structure
guide.adversity.sanctuary.structure.desc=The artificial sanctuary requires a specific 3-layer structure to be built correctly:
guide.adversity.sanctuary.structure.layer1=Layer 1 (Base): 5x5 Quartz Block platform as foundation
guide.adversity.sanctuary.structure.layer2=Layer 2 (Middle): 3x3 ring of Cobblestone/Stone Bricks with Sanctuary Altar in center
guide.adversity.sanctuary.structure.layer3=Layer 3 (Top): Quartz Stairs facing outward at each corner
guide.adversity.sanctuary.structure.tip=Tip: Right-click altar to check structure validity. Invalid parts shown in red particles.

guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy=Entropy Fuel
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.desc=Sanctuaries require entropy items as fuel to operate. Entropy items drop from elite mobs.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.shard=Entropy Shard: Basic fuel (10 points), drops from T1-T4 elites
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.crystal=Entropy Crystal: Medium fuel (50 points), drops from T5-T7 elites or crafted from shards
guide.adversity.sanctuary.entropy.core=Entropy Core: High fuel (200 points), drops from T8-T10 elites or crafted from crystals

guide.adversity.sanctuary.protection=Protection Effects
guide.adversity.sanctuary.protection.desc=Sanctuaries provide multiple layers of protection for players within their range. Protection scales with sanctuary tier (T1-T5).
guide.adversity.sanctuary.protection.elite=Elite Suppression: Reduces elite spawn rate by 30-95%% based on tier
guide.adversity.sanctuary.protection.affix=Affix Damage Reduction: Reduces affix damage by 30-50%% based on tier
guide.adversity.sanctuary.protection.bauble=Bauble Boost: 100%% bauble effectiveness (50%% outside sanctuary)
guide.adversity.sanctuary.protection.craft=Crafting/Enchanting: Unlocks special recipes and enchantments within range

# Sanctuary Modes
guide.adversity.sanctuary.modes=Operating Modes
guide.adversity.sanctuary.modes.desc=Right-click the altar to cycle between 3 operating modes:
guide.adversity.sanctuary.modes.safe=§aSAFE§r (Default): Blocks elite spawns within radius. Best for base building.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.modes.farm=§eFARM§r: Allows elites but caps their tier (T1-T4). Good for controlled farming.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.modes.ease=§bEASE§r: Reduces overall difficulty multiplier in the zone. Fuel cost increased.

# Affix Damage Suppression
guide.adversity.sanctuary.suppress=Affix Damage Suppression
guide.adversity.sanctuary.suppress.natural=§aNatural Sanctuary§r: T1=30%%, T2=35%%, T3=40%%, T4=45%% affix damage reduction (formula: 25%%+5%%/tier)
guide.adversity.sanctuary.suppress.artificial=§7Artificial Sanctuary§r: Uses base formula at tier 0 = 25%% affix damage reduction

# Sanctuary Upgrade
guide.adversity.sanctuary.upgrade=Tier Upgrades
guide.adversity.sanctuary.upgrade.desc=Natural sanctuaries can be upgraded by performing upgrade rituals at the altar. Higher tiers expand radius and improve all protection effects.
guide.adversity.sanctuary.upgrade.t1=§aT1§r: 50%% elite suppression, 30%% affix suppression
guide.adversity.sanctuary.upgrade.t2=§eT2§r: 75%% elite suppression, 35%% affix suppression
guide.adversity.sanctuary.upgrade.t3=§6T3§r: 90%% elite suppression, 40%% affix suppression

# Baubles Page
guide.adversity.baubles.title=Ward Baubles
guide.adversity.baubles.intro=Ward baubles are special equipment items that protect you from specific affix effects. Their effects are significantly enhanced within sanctuary zones!

guide.adversity.baubles.equipment=Equipment Ward
guide.adversity.baubles.soul_chain=Soul Chain: Protects against Shackle (armor seal), 100%% immunity in sanctuary
guide.adversity.baubles.spatial_anchor=Spatial Anchor: Protects against Divest (bauble seal), grants attack boost on block
guide.adversity.baubles.enchant_guardian=Enchant Guardian: Protects against Disenchant, restores XP on block

guide.adversity.baubles.elemental=Elemental Ward
guide.adversity.baubles.flame_ward=Flame Ward: Protects against Fiery burn stacks, auto-clears at max
guide.adversity.baubles.frost_ward=Frost Ward: Protects against Frosty freeze, brief invincibility on trigger
guide.adversity.baubles.corrosion_bane=Corrosion Bane: Protects against Withering corrosion, reflects damage at max

guide.adversity.baubles.special=Special Ward
guide.adversity.baubles.guardian_heart=Guardian Heart: Protects against permanent curses (Black Swan/Friday/Coffin)
guide.adversity.baubles.anchor_stone=Anchor Stone: Protects against Gravity pull, trade-off: reduced move speed
guide.adversity.baubles.clarity_lens=Clarity Lens: Protects against Blinding vision loss, trade-off: position shared
guide.adversity.baubles.courage_charm=Courage Charm: Protects against Horror fear, trade-off: increased fear damage

guide.adversity.baubles.counter=Counter Baubles
guide.adversity.baubles.balance_charm=Balance Charm: Counters Reversal affix - normalizes damage output
guide.adversity.baubles.immunity_badge=Immunity Badge: Counters Tetanus affix - slows debuff stack buildup
guide.adversity.baubles.memory_crystal=Memory Crystal: Counters Oblivion affix - protects experience from being drained
guide.adversity.baubles.soul_seal_dust=Soul Seal Dust: Counters Ascension affix - prevents enemy resurrection
guide.adversity.baubles.light_amulet=Light Amulet: Counters Avarice/Greed - reduces damage penalties from items/baubles
guide.adversity.baubles.anchor_heart=Anchor Heart: Counters Teleporting affix - prevents enemy teleportation near you
guide.adversity.baubles.armor_pierce=Armor Pierce: Counters Fortified affix - ignores bonus armor from elite mobs
guide.adversity.baubles.barrier_ward=Barrier Ward: Counters Aura affixes - reduces damage from aura effects
guide.adversity.baubles.guardian_soul=Guardian Soul: Enhanced Shackle counter - extends protection to nearby allies
guide.adversity.baubles.purify_badge=Purify Badge: Counters Stack affixes - clears debuff stacks periodically
guide.adversity.baubles.true_crystal=True Crystal: Counters Reflect/Adaptive - reveals true damage vulnerabilities

guide.adversity.baubles.offensive=Offensive Baubles
guide.adversity.baubles.bloodrage_emblem=Bloodrage Emblem: 5%% lifesteal, attack speed boost at low HP, heal on kill
guide.adversity.baubles.phantom_cloak=Phantom Cloak: Invisibility while sneaking, +40%% backstab damage, -50%% aggro
guide.adversity.baubles.thunder_ring=Thunder Ring: Chain lightning on hit, +20%% damage in rain, lightning immunity
guide.adversity.baubles.aegis_medal=Aegis Medal: -15%% damage to nearby allies, revival buffs on teammate death

guide.adversity.baubles.utility=Utility Baubles
guide.adversity.baubles.void_heart=Void Heart: No ender pearl damage, enhanced End dimension effects, void protection
guide.adversity.baubles.temporal_watch=Temporal Watch: -20%% attack speed for enemies within 8 blocks, triggers 2s time stop on fatal damage (3min CD)
guide.adversity.baubles.wither_mark=Wither Mark: Counters Lifesteal/Regen affixes - reduces enemy healing effects by 50%%

guide.adversity.baubles.sanctuary_bonus=Sanctuary Bonus
guide.adversity.baubles.sanctuary_bonus.desc=Within sanctuary zones, all bauble protection effects are amplified based on sanctuary type. Natural sanctuaries provide 100%% effect (full immunity), artificial sanctuaries provide 50%%. Outside sanctuary, effects drop to base value (~30-50%%).

# Enchantments Page
guide.adversity.enchants.title=Anti-Adversity Enchants
guide.adversity.enchants.intro=These special enchantments help you combat elite mobs and affix effects. Obtainable at enchanting tables or through other means.

guide.adversity.enchants.list=Enchantment List
guide.adversity.enchants.soulbound=Soulbound: Protects equipment from Shackle seal. Lv1: 33%% / Lv2: 66%% / Lv3: 100%% block chance
guide.adversity.enchants.breaker=Breaker: Attacks have 10/20/30%% chance to remove one random affix from elites
guide.adversity.enchants.entropy_affinity=Entropy Affinity: +25%%/+50%% entropy drops from elites (armor enchant)
guide.adversity.enchants.purifying_touch=Purifying Touch: Reduces seal duration by 30%%/50%%/70%% (armor enchant)
guide.adversity.enchants.resolute_will=Resolute Will: Immune to Purifier affix's potion theft effect

# Tips Page
guide.adversity.tips.title=Survival Tips
guide.adversity.tips.beginner=Beginner Tips
guide.adversity.tips.beginner.1=Early game difficulty is low - safe distance is 15000 blocks from origin. Establish a base before exploring further.
guide.adversity.tips.beginner.2=Prioritize collecting entropy shards - they're key resources for progression
guide.adversity.tips.beginner.3=Activate natural sanctuaries immediately - they become forward bases for exploration

guide.adversity.tips.advanced=Advanced Strategies
guide.adversity.tips.advanced.1=Combine baubles and enchantments to counter most affix combinations
guide.adversity.tips.advanced.2=Build an artificial sanctuary network in high-difficulty areas for safe retreat
guide.adversity.tips.advanced.3=Watch for dangerous affix combos (Fiery+Frosty, Shackle+Divest)

guide.adversity.tips.danger=Danger Warnings
guide.adversity.tips.danger.1=Permanent curses (Black Swan/Friday/Coffin) are most dangerous - always carry Guardian Heart!
guide.adversity.tips.danger.2=T8+ elites are extremely dangerous - don't challenge without full preparation

